  "body": "On Ubuntu 24.04 LTS I've downloaded, unzipped and installed `ART-1.25.7-linux64.tar.xz`, however, when running ./ART it errors with\n\n```\ng_module_open() failed for /tmp/tmp.jprNvqe6dd-ART/ART/lib/gdk-pixbuf-2.0/2.10.0/loaders/libpixbufloader-png.so: /tmp/tmp.jprNvqe6dd-ART/ART/lib/gdk-pixbuf-2.0/2.10.0/loaders/libpixbufloader-png.so: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n./ART: line 57: /tmp/tmp.jprNvqe6dd-ART/ART/.ART.bin: No such file or directory\n```\n\nThe last ART version I can get working is 1.25.2\n\n`libpixbufloader-png.so` exists in the `lib` subfolder for 1.25.2 but not 1.25.7\n\nIs there anything I can do to get 1.25.7 working please?",
